  "title": "Sustained Neural Representations of Personally Familiar People and Places During Cued Recall",
  "description": "This dataset comprises MEG recordings collected to investigate the sustained neural representations of personally familiar people and places during a cued recall task. Participants were cued to recall familiar individuals and locations while brain activity was measured to examine the temporal dynamics of memory-related representations.",
